OL,3,CFerndale wildfire reignited by
OL,4,C'deliberate fire-setting'
OL,6,FA large wildfire on Llanwonno Mountain
OL,7,Fin Ferndale has been reignited due to
OL,8,F"deliberate fire setting".
OL,10,FFire crews had been battling the blaze
OL,11,Fover several days and on Monday (3
OL,12,FAugust) it was declared a major
OL,13,Fincident. However that status was
OL,14,Fstood down on Thursday and the flames
OL,15,Fbrought under control.
OL,17,FFour days later on Monday 10, the fire
OL,18,Fservice said it was aware the fire had
OL,19,Frestarted and it is now trying to
OL,20,Fbring the incident to a close.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/4
