OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786614494
OL,3,CFerndale wildfire reignited by
OL,4,C'deliberate fire-setting'
OL,6,FA statement read: "Due to deliberate
OL,7,Ffire setting in the area, the wildfire
OL,8,Fin Llanwonno and Penrhys, Ferndale has
OL,9,Fbeen reignited. Thank you for your
OL,10,Fcalls, we want to reassure you that
OL,11,Four crews are in attendance and
OL,12,Fworking hard to bring the incident to
OL,13,Fa safe close.
OL,15,F"South Wales Police are patrolling the
OL,16,Farea, to deter any further deliberate
OL,17,Ffires, along with our Arson Reduction
OL,18,FTeam."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
