PN,43803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786614494
OL,3,CFerndale wildfire reignited by
OL,4,C'deliberate fire-setting'
OL,6,FThe force urged local people to be
OL,7,Fvigilant and report and suspicious
OL,8,Fbehaviour in relation to deliberate
OL,9,Ffire setting.
OL,11,FThey added: "We want to thank the
OL,12,Fcommunity for your support and
OL,13,Funderstanding, only by working
OL,14,Ftogether can we stop these deliberate
OL,15,Ffires from starting."
OL,17,FCrews from multiple fire services have
OL,18,Falso been dealing with another major
OL,19,Fblaze. A fire around Llangynidr
OL,20,FReservoir, in Ebbw Vale, broke out
OL,21,Flate Friday afternoon (7 August).
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
