OL,3,CFerndale wildfire reignited by
OL,4,C'deliberate fire-setting'
OL,6,FDays later, smoke could be seen from
OL,7,Fplaces like Blaenavon, Brynmawr,
OL,8,FPontypool, Newport, Tredegar and
OL,9,Fnearby communities.
